    "CF-V0-011",
    "CF-V0-013"
  ],
  "intent": "CF-V0-011 emits exactly one INTENT_CHANGE item and NO INTENT_TEST item for an OCM unknown obligation, because no selected test edge exists. Fabricating a test item would be an invented obligation.",
